    <h2>Key Takeaways for VA Loan Rates in 2026</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>✅ Monitor economic indicators and rate trends throughout 2026</li>
      <li>✅ Understand your rate lock options and timeline</li>
      <li>✅ Compare VA lenders to find competitive rates and low fees</li>
      <li>✅ Evaluate points vs. no-points options for your situation</li>
      <li>✅ Work with experienced VA lenders who know San Antonio market</li>
      <li>✅ Lock rates strategically when you have an accepted offer</li>
      <li>✅ Remember: VA loans often beat conventional rates PLUS save PMI</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

